{"review_id": "12720241108", "app_id": "1476563238", "app_name": "Ultiself | Self-Improvement", "country": "sa", "country_name": "Saudi Arabia", "rating": 1, "title": "Unauthorized Charge & No Response from Support", "body": "Ultiself charged my account $57.57 USD on May 31, 2025, for a transaction I never authorized. I contacted their support immediately, but received no response. Despite being told by my card provider that the funds would be released if not charged, the transaction was completed, and Ultiself has not issued a refund.\n\nTerrible customer service and no accountability. I’m now forced to dispute the charge through my bank. Be very careful with this app.", "author": "Mak.L30", "date": "2025-05-31T17:16:42Z", "vote_count": 0, "vote_sum": 0, "is_edited": false}
